sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Spring Boot Application
    participant Primary as Primary Node (DB-01)
    participant DCS as Consensus / DCS (etcd / Consul)
    participant Monitor as HA Manager (Patroni / Orchestrator)
    participant Replica as Standby Replica (DB-02)

    Note over Primary,Replica: Steady State: Streaming WAL Replication
    Primary->>DCS: Heartbeat Lease Renewal (TTL: 10s)
    Primary->>Replica: Physical WAL Streaming

    Note over Primary: Primary Node Hardware or Network Failure occurs!
    Primary--x DCS: Heartbeat Lease Expires (Loss of Leadership)
    Monitor->>DCS: Detect Lease Expiration
    Monitor->>Primary: Fencing / STONITH (Ensure Dead to prevent Split-Brain)

    Note over Monitor,Replica: Elect Promotion Candidate
    Monitor->>Replica: Query Latest Received WAL LSN
    Monitor->>Replica: Issue Promotion Trigger (pg_promote / touch trigger_file)
    Replica->>Replica: Exit Recovery Mode & Accept Writes (Read-Write Mode)
    Replica->>DCS: Acquire Primary Leader Lock

    Note over App,Replica: Application Service Discovery Update
    DCS-->>App: DNS / VIP / Service Discovery Update (New Primary IP: DB-02)
    App->>Replica: Reconnect HikariCP & Resume Write Transactions
